{"id":"en_her-revenge-is-billion-dollar","title":"Her Revenge Is Billion-Dollar","titleEn":"Her Revenge Is Billion-Dollar","description":"Chloe, the rightful heiress of the Williams family, once lived a life that ended in tragedy. In her previous existence, Eric, the family's adopted son, wrongly accused her of taking a crucial project. Her parents took his side, cast her out, and she died of exposure on the streets. Given a second chance, she returns to the exact day she was thrown out and leaves without a backward glance. A decade afterward, she has risen to become a leading venture capital figure, running Peak Capital. Her Revenge Is Billion-Dollar can be followed on Dramzio.","poster":"https://cdn2.nsstorage.space/her-revenge-is-billion-dollar/en_US/a07426ca32bd65ac/cover.webp","backdrop":"https://cdn2.nsstorage.space/her-revenge-is-billion-dollar/en_US/a07426ca32bd65ac/cover.webp","kind":"series","year":2025,"genres":["Female Empowerment","Rebirth","Underdog Rise","Short Drama"],"featured":false,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7dn7vm/?pub=4occak","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}],"episodes":[{"id":"ep_her-revenge-is-billion-dollar_1","title":"Episode 1","season":1,"number":1,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7dn7vm/?pub=4occak","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}]},{"id":"ep_her-revenge-is-billion-dollar_2","title":"Episode 2","season":1,"number":2,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7dn7vm/?pub=4occak","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}]},{"id":"ep_her-revenge-is-billion-dollar_3","title":"Episode 3","season":1,"number":3,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7dn7vm/?pub=4occak","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}]},{"id":"ep_her-revenge-is-billion-dollar_4","title":"Episode 4","season":1,"number":4,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","labe